            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "The embedding description loses its ExLlamaV2 prefix, but MMEmbeddings is plural prose rather than the actual MMEmbedding class name. The signature accepts one list or a batch of lists; generate normalizes the single-prompt case and passes each prompt's embeddings to tokenization and Job.",
            "basis": "source",
            "evidence": [
              "call_7d6720e20ac442a0819ad7c77b38240c",
              "call_e962e131a5794ffbb6c93da3bbaaa67a",
              "call_303d1c67fc714dc59a259635fc0e9ba2",
              "call_b17516b834704c9993adb3f68d39d6dd"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "The inherited cancellation wakeup concern is carried over unchanged: cancel sets a flag after removing the job, while the iterator checks that flag only before awaiting queue.get. The comment-only diff supplies no wakeup mechanism.",
